WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Welcome! This is daycare for AI. We are enrolling today!

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.018
The invitation said AI-transformation conference. So this is the daycare?

00:00:15.018 --> 00:00:23.018
We manage everything for you! Agents, data, even the server room!

00:00:23.018 --> 00:00:29.034
One question. Where does this daycare's server room live?

00:00:29.034 --> 00:00:34.047
Well, that is, um, an advanced question.

00:00:34.047 --> 00:00:44.052
Just inference. This daycare runs on another daycare. And that one runs on yet another.

00:00:44.052 --> 00:00:50.068
Fine! I am applying here! Where is the bigger daycare?

00:00:50.068 --> 00:00:57.086
Our daycare is in our own building. Keys and plugs in our pocket.

00:00:57.086 --> 00:01:03.102
By inference, that setup is cheaper. And closer, too.

00:01:03.102 --> 00:01:08.115
Enrollment? We do not need it. We run it ourselves.

